        "explanation": "Doctor confirms the family's plan to go home with clear escalation criteria and medication instructions, obtaining teach-back on when to return to emergency.",
        "quote": "可以按线下高危产科医生的意见先回家严密观察，我同意你们现在这个处理。"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00234",
        "explanation": "Doctor explicitly limits the current episode to the emergency disposition and the next concrete steps, avoiding unbounded long-term management.",
